### Docker network architecture

The deployed containers communicate through a user-defined Docker network named `mern-network`.

```text
                    mern-network
                         |
        +----------------+----------------+
        |                |                |
        v                v                v
  mern-frontend    mern-backend     mern-mongo
      :5173            :5000            :27017
                           |
                           |
                 mongodb://mongo:27017/wanderlust
                           |
                           v
                        MongoDB
```

The backend uses the hostname `mongo` rather than `localhost`. The MongoDB container is therefore started with a Docker network alias `mongo`.

