## 11. Complete Deployment Procedure Without Docker Compose

The following is the CLI-based deployment workflow used for the project.

### Step 1 — Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/iamajaypokharel/wanderlust-Devops-mern.git
cd wanderlust-Devops-mern
```

