## 21. Final Deployment Summary

The completed project demonstrates how to deploy a real MERN application on AWS EC2 using Docker without depending on Docker Compose for the actual runtime workflow.

The key DevOps concepts demonstrated are:

- source control with Git and GitHub
- Docker image creation
- separate containers for frontend, backend, and database
- Docker bridge networking
- Docker DNS and network aliases
- MongoDB data persistence using volumes
- environment-based application configuration
- API/CORS configuration
- AWS EC2 networking and security groups
- container logging and troubleshooting
- rebuild/redeploy workflows

### Final runtime model

```text
                    PUBLIC INTERNET
